Package: porelo-matrix-homeserver
Version: [[deb.version]]
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Michael Schnell <michael@fuin.org>
Depends: porelo-message-transport-matrix, podman
Provides: porelo-homeserver
Homepage: https://github.com/porelo-ai/porelo-message-matrix
Description: The local Matrix homeserver for Porelo's transport
 A systemd user unit that runs the homeserver Porelo's Matrix transport talks
 to, in rootless podman, on loopback only, for the account that enables it:
 systemctl --user enable --now porelo-matrix-homeserver
